Iced canvas glyph rendering adaptation
======================================

src/canvas/text_cache/glyphs.rs adapts Text::draw_with from iced_graphics 0.14.0:
https://github.com/iced-rs/iced/blob/3997291f318a8bc06fa522f5579836fb3feb94df/graphics/src/geometry/text.rs

Copyright 2019 Héctor Ramón, Iced contributors
Licensed under MIT; see LICENSE in this directory.

ReShiki retains Iced's paragraph shaping, font-size hinting, glyph path commands
and bitmap/color fallback. Its adaptation restricts placement to top-left at the
origin and reuses a bounded Swash glyph cache between text strings, with explicit
memory/entry accounting and eviction. These adapted portions retain their MIT
terms and are not represented as original dual-licensed ReShiki code.

Patched iced_winit
==================

vendor/iced_winit is iced_winit 0.14.1 from crates.io
(https://github.com/iced-rs/iced/tree/0.14/winit), patched so that the browser
build receives input method text; vendor/iced_winit/UPSTREAM.json lists the
upstream file hashes and every local change. Copyright 2019 Héctor Ramón,
Iced contributors; licensed under MIT (vendor/iced_winit/LICENSE, the same text
as LICENSE in this directory).
